<title>GERMANY: Fiat sees 25.8 pct hike in German car sales.</title>
<headline>Fiat sees 25.8 pct hike in German car sales.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian carmaker Fiat said on Wednesday that its car sales in the German market increase by 25.8 percent in 1996 to 164,484 units under its Alfa Romeo, Fiat and Lancia brands.</p>
<p>This brings Fiat's market share in Germany up to 4.8 percent in 1996 from four percent the previous year, Fiat's German unit Fiat Automobil AG said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
